-- ACCURACY PATCH: crosshairTarget already proved unobstructed LOS to the actual
-- hit part. The old double-check (isCharVisibleAny over Head/UpperTorso/LowerTorso)
-- was rejecting valid arm/leg peeks. When visibilityCheck is on, we now do a strict
-- head-or-torso re-check (preserving original intent) using the fixed hasClearLine.
